  "tag": "v2026.11.15.3",
  "title": "ML Studio 2026.11.15.3",
  "notes": "- Choose Console LED, Backlit Square or REC Badge for the Playlist and Channel Rack. Customize each view\u2019s idle, armed and recording colors, light size and glow in Settings > Theme > Record lights.\n- Drag effect names to reorder them on the same Mixer insert. Long effect names keep their normal text size and clip to the available space.\n- Customize Traditional Mixer insert knobs and stereo peak meters, including knob faces, pointers and rings, meter colors and shape, and peak lines.\n- Added quick theme colors for Mixer labels and buttons, the Playlist toolbar and overview, and Settings headings and tabs. The color picker now has a hue and saturation wheel with a brightness slider.\n- The Plug-in Picker accepts spaces in searches and effect-chain names.\n- On Windows x64, the app now includes the renderer needed for ML Visualizer MP4 export. First-time setup can install AudioVisualizer and FFmpeg together.\n- Rebuilt the bundled ML Plasma plug-in for macOS 12 compatibility on Intel and Apple silicon, addressing a startup crash on older macOS versions.\n\nhttps://michaellanemusic.de/ml-studio/",
